 - https://www.swedbank.se/foretag/digitala-tjanster/internetbanken-foretag/vanliga-fragor-och-svar.html
 - https://www.swedbank.se/foretag/betala-och-ta-betalt/ny-standard-for-betalningar-i-sverige.html
